   "evidence": "The DCF is $212 at a 9.0% cost of equity; the 31.0x four-year mean P/E implies $303 on FY2027 EPS of $9.79; revenue compounded 5.0% a year from FY2021 to the last twelve months [S6, S10, S7, S97].",
